@Orders_HostAddress = http://localhost:5202

### Submit a new order
POST {{Orders_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-001",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "productName": "Wireless Mouse",
      "unitPrice": 29.99,
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "productId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
      "productName": "Mechanical Keyboard",
      "unitPrice": 89.99,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Get order by ID (replace {id} with the ID returned from the POST above)
GET {{Orders_HostAddress}}/api/orders/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

### Get orders by customer
GET {{Orders_HostAddress}}/api/orders?customerId=cust-001
Accept: application/json

###
